===Stickers===
Registration plates become valid with the official seal of registration.<ref name="FZV" />{{rp|§12(3)}} This is a sticker of {{cvt|45|mm|frac=8}} diameter, following the area code and bearing, in colours, the seal of the respective German {{lang|de|[[States of Germany|Bundesland]]}} with the name of the state and the issuing district authority added in print. Older stickers were monochrome, black on silver or white, and smaller ({{cvt|35|mm|frac=8|disp=semicolon}}), depicting the seal of either the Bundesland or the city district. Vehicles used by federal institutions, such as {{lang|de|[[Federal Police (Germany)|Bundespolizei]]}}, carry the German {{lang|de|[[Coat of arms of Germany|Bundesadler]]}} instead of a {{lang|de|Bundesland}} seal.
